meta {
  name: Put RSVP
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

put {
  url: {{apiOrigin}}/rsvp
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{invitationToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "attending": true,
    "plusOnesCount": 0,
    "accessibility": {
      "stepFreeAccess": true,
      "aisleSeat": true,
      "note": "Test note, not real data"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Guest RSVP. `accessibility` (#176) is optional: omitted keeps what is
  stored, `null` clears it, an object replaces it (unset flags are false).
  Accessibility needs are sensitive: never paste real ones into a shared
  collection.
}
